<title>USA: Medarex, Houston Bio in definitive deal.</title>
<headline>Medarex, Houston Bio in definitive deal.</headline>
<dateline>ANNANDALE, N.J. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medarex Inc said on Friday that it and Houston Biotechnology Inc have entered into a definitive agreement for Medarex to acquire Houston Biotechnology.</p>
<p>In the acquisition, Medarex would issue 0.182 share of its common stock in exchange for each of the 5,638,707 outstanding shares of the common stock of Houston Biotechnology.</p>
<p>Earlier this month, Medarex had said that it and Houston Biotechnology were in a tentatvie agreement for the acquisition.</p>
</text>
